// Zero-dimensional (global) model on one cell whose faces are all empty: the
// species change by the chemistry alone. Needs plasmaChemistryModel temporal
// (constant/chemistryProperties) and poissonEquationSolver none
// (constant/electroMagnetics)
// Zero-dimensional CF4/O2 model on one cell (see MECHANISM.md). Needs
// plasmaChemistryModel temporal and poissonEquationSolver none. Transport is
// not used in 0D: ions and neutrals have zero mobility and diffusion.
plasmaModel  zeroD<constGasThermoPhysics>;
activeSpecies 13;
backgroundGas CF4;
multiTimeStep false;
fluxScheme      fvSchemes;

